# PROD stack env for the MyLLMBox Harness deploy.
#
# The ONE required value is the Cloudflare tunnel token. Create a NAMED tunnel in the CF Zero Trust
# dashboard (Networks → Tunnels → Create a tunnel → Cloudflared), then under Public Hostnames add:
#
#     harness.myllmbox.com   →   Service: http://localhost:8011
#
# (cloudflared runs on the host network and the UI is published at 127.0.0.1:8011 — see
# docker-compose.yml. If you prefer http://ui:80 instead, adjust the compose network accordingly.)
#
# Copy the tunnel's token (the long value after `--token` in the install snippet) here. The stack reads
# only this file; the token is the whole binding — no local cloudflared config.
TUNNEL_TOKEN=
